  "releaseNotes": "Version: 2026.8.1\n\nNative Agents: com.appdynamics.eum.android:mobile-android:26.8.0.3448, com.appdynamics.eum:mobile-ios-internal-fat-library:2022.5.0.2956, com.appdynamics.eum:mobile-ios:2024.12.0.4567\n\nChanges:\n\n1. Migrated to .NET 9 framework (net9.0-android, net9.0-ios)\n2. Enhanced build automation with comprehensive Make targets\n3. Updated dotnet-install.sh for .NET 9 support\n4. Improved documentation with .NET 9 migration guide\n5. Added comprehensive validation and testing tools\n6. Support for capturing native crashes for iOS and Android\n7. Updated Appium to latest 9.4.0 version\n8. Component tests now support latest iOS simulators and Android emulators",
